<http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/HCA> ccmm_props:ISO_639_3 "hca"^^<http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#ISO_639_3>; ccmm_props:XML_LNG "hca"^^<http://publications.europa.eu/ontology/euvoc#XML_LNG>; a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "Andaman Hindi"@en, "Andaman Hindi"@hca, "अण्डमान क्रियोल हिन्दी"@hca; skos:definition "Andaman Creole Hindi is a trade language of the Andaman Islands, spoken as a native language especially in Port Blair and villages to the south. It is described as a creolization of Hindustani, Bengali, and Malayalam."@en; skos:inScheme <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language>; skos:prefLabel "андамански креолски хинди"@bg, "andamanská kreolská hindština"@cs, "andamansk hindikreolsk"@da, "Andamanen-Kreol-Hindi"@de, "κρεολική της χιντι των νησιών Άνταμαν"@el, "Andaman Creole Hindi"@en, "hindi criollo andamanés"@es, "andamani kreooli hindi"@et, "hindiin perustuva andamaanienkreoli"@fi, "hindi créole des îles Andaman"@fr, "Criól Hiondúise Andaman"@ga, "andamanski kreolski hindi"@hr, "andamán-szigeteki kreol hindi"@hu, "hindi creolo delle Andamane"@it, "andamanų kreolų hindi"@lt, "andamanu kreoliskā hindi valoda"@lv, "Ħindi Kreol tal-Gżejjer Andaman"@mt, "Andamanees creools Hindi"@nl, "hindi andamańskie"@pl, "crioulo hindi das ilhas Andamão"@pt, "hindi creolă andamaneză"@ro, "андаманский креольский хинди"@ru, "andamanská kreolská hindčina"@sk, "andamanska kreolska hindijščina"@sl, "andamanesisk kreol-hindi"@sv, "андаманский креольский хинди"@uk .
