<http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/C53B-JCY5> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "design patent"@da, "brevet de design"@fr, "registo de modelo"@pt, "brevet de proiectare"@ro, "mönsterskydd"@sv, "tasarım tescili"@tr; skos:broadMatch <https://sparontologies.github.io/fabio/current/fabio.html#d4e4551>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_15cd>; skos:definition "A patent granted to any person who has invented any new and non-obvious ornamental design for an article of manufacture. The design patent protects only the appearance of an article, but not its structural or functional features. [Source: Adapted from https://www.uspto.gov/patents/basics/types-patent-applications/design-patent-application-guide#def]"@en; skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme>; skos:prefLabel "براءة اختراع تصميم"@ar, "dizayn patenti"@az, "patent de disseny"@ca, "designregistrering"@da, "Eingetragenes Design"@de, "design patent"@en, "patente de diseño"@es, "mallipatentti"@fi, "brevet de conception"@fr, "patente de deseño"@gl, "formatervezési minta"@hu, "brevetto di design"@it, "意匠特許"@ja, "디자인 특허"@ko, "modelbescherming"@nl, "registo de desenho"@pt, "brevet de design"@ro, "патент на образец"@ru, "patent za oblikovanje"@sl, "patent za dizajn"@sr, "патент за дизајн"@sr-cyrl, "designskydd"@sv, "tasarım patenti"@tr, "патент на дизайн"@uk, "设计专利"@zh .
<http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/CQMR-7K63> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "datos grabados"@es, "geregistreerde gegevens"@nl, "opgenomen data"@nl, "zabeleženi podatki"@sl; skos:broadMatch <http://purl.org/datacite/v4.4/Dataset>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_ddb1>; skos:definition "Data registered by mechanical or electronic means, in a form that allows the information to be retrieved and/or reproduced. For example, images or sounds on disc or magnetic tape. [Source: Adapted from https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/ModeOfCollection_3.0.html]"@en; skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme>; skos:prefLabel "بيانات مسجلة"@ar, "qeydə alınmış məlumat"@az, "dades enregistrades"@ca, "optaget data"@da, "aufgezeichnete Daten"@de, "καταγεγραμμένα δεδομένα"@el, "recorded data"@en, "datos registrados"@es, "tallennettu data"@fi, "donnée enregistrée"@fr, "datos rexistrados"@gl, "rögzített adatok"@hu, "dati registrati"@it, "記録データ"@ja, "기록 데이터"@ko, "vastgelegde data"@nl, "dados registados"@pt, "date înregistrate"@ro, "записанные данные"@ru, "posneti podatki"@sl, "snimljeni podaci"@sr, "снимљени подаци"@sr-cyrl, "kayıtlı veri"@tr, "зафіксовані дані"@uk, "记录数据"@zh; skos:relatedMatch <http://vocabs.lter-europe.net/elter_cl/10021> .
<http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/D97F-VB57> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "comentari"@ca, "değerlendirme"@tr; skos:broadMatch <https://sparontologies.github.io/fabio/current/fabio.html#d4e2568>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_efa0>; skos:definition "A commentary is a more in-depth analysis written to draw attention to a work already published. Commentaries are somewhat like “reviews” in that the author presents his or her analysis of a work and why it  would be of interest to a specific audience. [Source: https://www.enago.com/academy/perspective-opinion-and-commentary-pieces]"@en; skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme>; skos:prefLabel "تعليق"@ar, "rəy"@az, "opinió"@ca, "kommentar"@da, "Kommentar"@de, "σχολιασμός"@el, "commentary"@en, "comentario"@es, "kritiikki"@fi, "commentaire"@fr, "comentario"@gl, "kommentár"@hu, "commentario"@it, "論評"@ja, "논평"@ko, "commentaar"@nl, "comentário"@pl, "комментарий"@pt, "comentariu"@ro, "комментарий"@ru, "komentar"@sl, "komentar"@sr, "коментар"@sr-cyrl, "kommentar"@sv, "yorum"@tr, "коментар"@uk, "评注"@zh .
<http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/DD58-GFSX> a skos:Concept; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_ddb1>; skos:definition "Data resulting from assessing specific properties (or characteristics) of beings, things, phenomena, (and/ or processes) by applying pre-established standards and/or specialized instruments or techniques. [Source: Adapted from  https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/ModeOfCollection_3.0.html]"@en; skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme>; skos:prefLabel "بيانات قياس واختبار"@ar, "ölçüm və test məlumatları"@az, "dades de mesures i proves"@ca, "måle- og testdata"@da, "Mess- und Testdaten"@de, "δεδομένα μετρήσεων και δοκιμών"@el, "measurement and test data"@en, "datos de medición y prueba"@es, "mittaus- ja testausdata"@fi, "donnée de mesure et d'essai"@fr, "datos de medicións e probas"@gl, "mérési és tesztelési adatok"@hu, "dati di misurazione e test"@it, "測定・評価データ"@ja, "측정・시험 데이터"@ko, "meet- en testdata"@nl, "dados de medição e de ensaio"@pt, "date de măsurare și testare"@ro, "данные измерений и испытаний"@ru, "merilni in testni podatki"@sl, "podaci merenja i ispitivanja"@sr, "подаци мерења и испитивања"@sr-cyrl, "ölçüm ve test verisi"@tr, "дані вимірювання і випробування"@uk, "测量与测试数据"@zh; skos:relatedMatch <http://vocabs.lter-europe.net/elter_cl/10017> .
<http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/DX5J-TA9R> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "plan de síntesis del conocimiento"@es, "plan de síntese do coñecemento"@gl, "protocol de evaluare a cunostințelor"@ro, "metodologija sinteze znanja"@sl, "načrt raziskave"@sl, "protokol za sintezo znanja"@sl; skos:broadMatch <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/MESH/D000078182>, <https://sparontologies.github.io/fabio/current/fabio.html#d4e5605>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_93fc>; skos:definition "In the context of systematic reviews and meta-analyses, a protocol is a document that presents an explicit plan for a systematic review. The protocol details the rationale and a priori methodological and analytical approach of the review. https://www.bmj.com/content/349/bmj.g7647"@en; skos:editorialNote "New concept included t be added to upcoming version 4.0"@en; skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme>; skos:prefLabel "بروتوكول توليف المعرفة"@ar, "biliyin sintezi protokolu"@az, "protocol de síntesi del coneixement"@ca, "systematisk protokol"@da, "Wissenssyntheseprotokoll"@de, "πρωτόκολλο σύνθεσης γνώσης"@el, "knowledge synthesis protocol"@en, "protocolo de síntesis del conocimiento"@es, "systemaattisen katsauksen protokolla"@fi, "protocole de synthèse"@fr, "protocolo de síntese do coñecemento"@gl, "szakirodalom áttekintési protokoll"@hu, "protocollo di sintesi"@it, "知識統合プロトコル"@ja, "지식통합 프로토콜"@ko, "kennissynthese protocol"@nl, "protocolo de síntese de conhecimentos"@pt, "protocol de sinteză a cunostințelor"@ro, "протокол синтеза знаний"@ru, "metodologija raziskave"@sl, "prokoll vid systematisk översikt"@sv, "bilgi sentezi protokolü"@tr, "протокол синтезу знань"@uk, "知识综合协议"@zh .
<http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/EHVM-H119> ns1:expires "2021-04-01"; a skos:Concept; skos:definition "Data that are used as primary sources to support technical or scientific enquiry, research, scholarship, or artistic activity, and that are used as evidence in the research process and/or are commonly accepted in the research community as necessary to validate research findings and results. [Source: https://casrai.org/term/research-data]"@en; skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme>; skos:prefLabel "research data"@en; skos:topConceptOf <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme> .
<http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/F8RT-TJK0> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "bədii əsər"@az, "treball artístic"@ca, "Kunstobjekt"@de, "künstlerische Arbeit"@de, "trabajo artístico"@es, "œuvre d'art"@fr, "œuvre picturale"@fr, "œuvre plastique"@fr, "traballo artístico"@gl, "oggetto d'arte"@it, "opera d'arte"@it, "criação artística"@pt, "obra artística"@pt, "lucrare artistică"@ro, "художественное произведение"@ru, "umetnina"@sl, "umetniška stvaritev"@sl, "umetnički rad"@sr, "уметнички рад"@sr-cyrl; skos:broadMatch schema:CreativeWork; skos:definition "A work of visual arts and performing arts, including musical works; dramatic works; pantomimes and choreographic works; motion picture and other audiovisual works; pictorial, graphic, sculptural and architectural works. Adapted from Law Insider: https://www.lawinsider.com/dictionary/artistic-works"@en; skos:editorialNote "New concept included for upcoming version 4.0"@en; skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme>; skos:prefLabel "عمل فني"@ar, "incəsənət nümunəsi"@az, "obra artística"@ca, "kunstnerisk værk"@da, "Kunstwerk"@de, "καλλιτεχνικό έργο"@el, "artistic work"@en, "obra artística"@es, "taiteellinen teos"@fi, "œuvre artistique"@fr, "obra artística"@gl, "művészeti alkotás"@hu, "materiale artistico"@it, "芸術作品"@ja, "예술작품"@ko, "artistiek werk"@nl, "trabalho artístico"@pt, "activitate artistică"@ro, "произведение искусства"@ru, "umetniško delo"@sl, "umetničko delo"@sr, "уметничко дело"@sr-cyrl, "konstnärligt arbete"@sv, "sanatsal çalışma"@tr, "твір мистецтва"@uk, "艺术作品"@zh; skos:topConceptOf <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme> .
<http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/FF4C-28RK> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "dades d'observació"@ca, "datos de observación"@gl; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_ddb1>; skos:definition "Data resulting from observational research, which involves collecting observations as they occur (for example, observing behaviors, events, development of condition or disease, etc.), without attempting to manipulate any of the independent variables. [Source:  Adapted from https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/ModeOfCollection_3.0.html]"@en; skos:editorialNote "Data resulting from observational research, which involves collecting observations as they occur (for example, observing behaviors, events, development of condition or disease, etc.), without attempting to manipulate any of the independent variables. [Source:  Adapted from https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/ModeOfCollection_3.0.html]"@en; skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme>; skos:narrowMatch <http://vocabs.lter-europe.net/elter_cl/10018>; skos:prefLabel "بيانات رصدية"@ar, "müşahidə məlumatları"@az, "dades observacionals"@ca, "observationsdata"@da, "Beobachtungsdaten"@de, "παρατηρησιακά δεδομένα"@el, "observational data"@en, "datos observacionales"@es, "havaintoaineisto"@fi, "donnée d'observation"@fr, "datos observacionais"@gl, "megfigyelési adatok"@hu, "dati osservazionali"@it, "観測データ"@ja, "관측데이터"@ko, "observatiedata"@nl, "dados observacionais"@pt, "date observaționale"@ro, "данные наблюдений"@ru, "opazovalni podatki"@sl, "podaci prikupljeni posmatranjem"@sr, "подаци прикупљени посматрањем"@sr-cyrl, "observationsdata"@sv, "gözlemsel veri"@tr, "дані спостереження"@uk, "观测数据"@zh .
<http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/FXF3-D3G7> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "بيانات موحدة"@ar, "afledte data"@da, "date adunate"@ro, "kompilirani podaci"@sr, "компилирани подаци"@sr-cyrl, "kompilerad data"@sv; skos:broadMatch <http://purl.org/datacite/v4.4/Dataset>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_ddb1>; skos:definition "Data collected or assembled from multiple, often heterogeneous sources that have one or more reference points in common, and at least one of the sources was originally produced for other purposes. The data are incorporated in a new entity. For example, providing data on the number of universities in the last 150 years using a variety of available sources (e.g. finance documents, official statistics, university registers), combining survey data with information about geographical areas from official statistics (e.g. population density, doctors per capita, etc.), or using RSS to collect blog posts or tweets, etc. [Source: Adapted from https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/ModeOfCollection_3.0.html]"@en; skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme>; skos:prefLabel "بيانات مجمعة"@ar, "tərtib edilmiş məlumatlar"@az, "dades compilades"@ca, "kompilerede data"@da, "kompilierte Daten"@de, "compiled data"@en, "datos compilados"@es, "yhdistetty data"@fi, "donnée compilée"@fr, "datos compilados"@gl, "összegyűjtött adatok"@hu, "dati compilati"@it, "編集データ"@ja, "컴파일 데이터"@ko, "gecompileerde data"@nl, "dados compilados"@pt, "date compilate"@ro, "компилированные данные"@ru, "sestavljeni podatki"@sl, "kompilacija podataka"@sr, "компилација података"@sr-cyrl, "sammanställd data"@sv, "derlenmiş veri"@tr, "компіляція даних"@uk, "汇编数据"@zh .
<http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/GPQ7-G5VE> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "obtenció de les varietats vegetals"@ca, "Pflanzensortenschutz"@de, "COB"@fr; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_15cd>; skos:definition "Plant variety protection, also called a \"plant breeder's right\" (PBR), is a form of intellectual property right granted to the breeder of a new plant variety . According to this right, certain acts concerning the exploitation of the protected variety require the prior authorization of the breeder. Plant variety protection is an independent sui generis form of protection, tailored to protect new plant varieties and has certain features in common with other intellectual property rights. [Source: https://www.wipo.int/edocs/pubdocs/en/wipo_pub_943_2018.pdf]"@en; skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme>; skos:prefLabel "حماية الأصناف النباتية"@ar, "bitki müxtəlifliyinin qorunması"@az, "protecció de les varietats vegetals"@ca, "plante nyheds beskyttelses"@da, "Sortenschutz"@de, "προστασία φυτικών ποικιλιών"@el, "plant variety protection"@en, "obtención de variedades vegetales"@es, "kasvinjalostajanoikeus"@fi, "certificat d'obtention végétale"@fr, "protección de variedades vexetais"@gl, "növényfajta-oltalom"@hu, "privativa di varietà vegetale"@it, "育成者権"@ja, "식물품종보호권"@ko, "plantenras bescherming"@nl, "proteção de variedades vegetais"@pt, "protecția soiurilor de plante"@ro, "охрана новых сортов растений"@ru, "žlahniteljska pravica"@sl, "zaštićena biljna sorta"@sr, "заштићена биљна сорта"@sr-cyrl, "växtförädlarrätt"@sv, "bitki çeşitliliğini koruma"@tr, "захист сортів рослин"@uk, "植物新品种保护"@zh .
<http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/GSZA-Y7V7> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "sistema de organización del conocimiento"@es, "système d'organisation de la connaissance"@fr, "sistema para a organización do coñecemento"@gl, "sistema organizzativo del sapere"@it; skos:definition "All types of schemes for organizing information and promoting knowledge management. Knowledge organization systems include classification schemes that organize materials at a general level (such as books on a shelf), subject headings that provide more detailed access, and authority files that control variant versions of key information (such as geographic names and personal names). They also include less-traditional schemes, such as semantic artifacts, semantic networks and ontologies. https://www.clir.org/pubs/reports/pub91/1knowledge/"@en; skos:editorialNote "New concept included for upcoming version 3.2"@en; skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme>; skos:narrowMatch <https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/MESH?p=classes&conceptid=D016437>, <https://sparontologies.github.io/fabio/current/fabio.html#d4e5645>, <https://sparontologies.github.io/fabio/current/fabio.html#d4e5735>, <https://sparontologies.github.io/fabio/current/fabio.html#d4e5828>, <https://vocabs.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/archecategory/model/controlledVocabulary>; skos:prefLabel "نظام تنظيم المعرفة"@ar, "biliyin təşkili sistemi"@az, "sistema d'organització del coneixement"@ca, "vidensorganisationssystem"@da, "Wissensorganisationssystem"@de, "σύστημα οργάνωσης γνώσης"@el, "knowledge organization system"@en, "sistema para la organización del conocimiento"@es, "tiedonhallintajärjestelmä"@fi, "système d'organisation des connaissances"@fr, "sistema de organización do coñecemento"@gl, "tudásszervezési rendszerek"@hu, "sistema di organizzazione della conoscenza"@it, "知識組織化体系"@ja, "지식조직체계"@ko, "kennissysteem"@nl, "sistema de organização do conhecimento"@pt, "sistem de organizare a cunoștinței"@ro, "система организации знаний"@ru, "sistem za organizacijo znanja"@sl, "sistem organizacije znanja"@sr, "систем организације знања"@sr-cyrl, "kunskapsorganisationssystem"@sv, "bilgi organizasyon sistemi"@tr, "система організації знання"@uk; skos:topConceptOf <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme> .
<http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/H41Y-FW7B> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "quadern de camp"@ca, "quadern de laboratori"@ca, "cuaderno electrónico de laboratorio"@es, "cahier de laboratoire"@fr, "laboratorijski zapis"@sl, "laboratorijski zvezek"@sl, "labbjournal"@sv; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_ddb1>; skos:definition "A laboratory notebook (colloq. lab notebook or lab book) is a primary record of research. Researchers use a lab notebook to document their hypotheses, experiments and initial analysis or interpretation of these experiments. This label is used both for traditional and electronic laboratory notebook. [Source: Adapted from https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lab_notebook]"@en; skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme>; skos:narrowMatch <http://purl.org/datacite/v4.4/ComputationalNotebook>; skos:prefLabel "ملاحظات مختبرية"@ar, "laboratoriya qeydləri"@az, "llibreta de laboratori"@ca, "laboratorienotesbog"@da, "Laborjournal"@de, "εργαστηριακό τετράδιο"@el, "laboratory notebook"@en, "cuaderno de laboratorio"@es, "laboratoriopäiväkirja"@fi, "carnet de laboratoire"@fr, "caderno de laboratorio"@gl, "laboratóriumi jegyzetfüzet"@hu, "quaderno di laboratorio"@it, "実験ノート"@ja, "연구 노트"@ko, "laboratorium-notitieboek"@nl, "caderno de laboratório"@pt, "caiet de laborator"@ro, "лабораторный блокнот"@ru, "laboratorijska beležka"@sl, "laboratorijske beleške"@sr, "лабораторијске белешке"@sr-cyrl, "laborationsjournal"@sv, "laboratuvar notları"@tr, "лабораторні нотатки"@uk, "实验室记录本"@zh .
<http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/H6QP-SC1X> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "logosímbol"@ca, "marca"@ca, "símbol"@ca, "marque commerciale"@fr, "marca registada"@pt; skos:definition """A sign used to distinguish the goods or services of one undertaking from those
of others. A trademark may consist of words and combinations of words (for
instance, names or slogans), logos, figures and images, letters, numbers,
sounds, or, in rare instances, smells or moving images, or a combination thereof. [Source: https://www.wipo.int/trademarks/en]"""@en; skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme>; skos:prefLabel "علامة تجارية"@ar, "ticari marka"@az, "logo"@ca, "varemærke"@da, "Warenzeichen"@de, "εμπορικό σήμα"@el, "trademark"@en, "marca"@es, "tavaramerkki"@fi, "marque déposée"@fr, "marca"@gl, "márka"@hu, "marchio depositato"@it, "商標"@ja, "상표"@ko, "handelsmerk"@nl, "marca"@pt, "marcă"@ro, "торговая марка"@ru, "blagovna znamka"@sl, "zaštitni znak"@sr, "заштитни знак"@sr-cyrl, "varumärke"@sv, "ticari marka"@tr, "торгова марка"@uk, "商标"@zh; skos:relatedMatch <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/MESH/D010330>; skos:topConceptOf <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme> .
