<http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme> dcterms:contributor "Antonia Nicolaou, Cyprus University of Technology, Cyprus", "Aysen Binen, Izmir Institute of Technology, Turkey", "Barbara Aristidou, Cyprus University of Technology, Cyprus", "Carmen Posse, University Library of Santiago de Compostela, Spain", "Christian Lacroix, University of Montreal, Canada", "Diana Furcila Mihalache, FECYT, Spain", "George Macgregor, University of Glasgow, UK", "Hyekyong Hwang, KISTI, Korea", "Iltifat Ibrahimov, Azerbaijan Technical University, Azerbaijan", "Irina Razumova, COAR", "Iryna Kuchma, EIFL, Ukraine", "Jessica Byström, Chalmers University, Sweden", "Julie Gauthier, University of Montreal, Canada", "Jussi Piipponnen, Finnish National Library Group, Finland", "Khayala Hajiyeva, Azerbaijan Technical University, Azerbaijan", "Krisztina Korosi, University Library of Corvinus University of Budapest, Hungary", "Paul Walk, Antleaf, UK", "Petra Magnusson, Chalmers University, Sweden", "Rawia Awadallah, Arab States Research and Education Network", "Sa-kwang Song, KISTI, Korea", "Wilko Steinhoff, DANS, The Netherlands"; dcterms:creator "Benedetta Gandolini, 4Science, Italy", "Corinna Schneider, Technische Informationsbibliothek (TIB), Germany", "Ellen Ramsey, COAR", "Gretchen Neidhardt, Northwestern University, United States", "Gültekin Gürdal, Izmir Institute of Technology Library, Turkey", "Isabel Bernal, CSIC, Spain (Editorial Board Chair)", "Jochen Schirrwagen, Aachen University, Germany", "Joseph Cera, University of California-Berkeley, US", "Katharina Menhard, Technische Universität Graz, Austria", "Kathleen Shearer, COAR", "Ku (Alan) Liping, Chinese Academy of Science", "Mick Eadie, University of Glasgow, United Kingdom", "Milan Ojsteršek, University of Maribor, Slovenia", "Milica Sevkusic, EIFL Serbia", "Pedro Príncipe, Universidade do Minho, Portugal", "Pierre Lasou, Université Laval, Canada", "Sebastiano Giorgi, UOC, Spain", "Tomoko Kataoka, JPCOAR, Japan", "Yoo Young Lee, University of Ottawa, Canada"; dcterms:description "The Resource Type vocabulary defines concepts to identify the genre of a resource. Such resources, like publications, research data, audio and video objects, are typically deposited in institutional and thematic repositories or published in ejournals. This vocabulary supports a hierarchical model that relates narrower and broader concepts. Multilingual labels regard regional distinctions in language and term. Concepts of this vocabulary are mapped with terms and concepts of similar vocabularies and dictionaries."; dcterms:modified "2026-05-26T12:00:59+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime; dcterms:title "Resource Types"; a skos:ConceptScheme; rdfs:label "Resource Types"; skos:hasTopConcept <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/542X-3S04>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/8KJG-QS0Y>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/EHVM-H119>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/F8RT-TJK0>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/GSZA-Y7V7>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/H6QP-SC1X>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/RMP5-3GQ6>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/S7R1-K5P0>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_12cc>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_15cd>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_1843>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_18cc>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_18cf>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_18hj>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_18wq>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_18ww>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_2659>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_26e4>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_393c>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_3e5a>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_5ce6>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_ba1f>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_c513>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_ddb1>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_e059>, <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_e9a0> .
