<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/63ng-b465> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "eksperimental məlumatlar"@az; skos:broadMatch <http://purl.org/datacite/v4.4/Dataset>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_ddb1>; skos:definition "Data resulting from the experimental research method involving the manipulation of some or all of the independent variables included in the hypotheses. [Source: Adapted from https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/ModeOfCollection_3.0.html]"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/63NG-B465>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "بيانات تجريبية"@ar, "sınaq məlumatları"@az, "dades experimentals"@ca, "eksperimentelle data"@da, "experimentelle Daten"@de, "πειραματικά δεδομένα"@el, "experimental data"@en, "datos experimentales"@es, "kokeellinen data"@fi, "donnée expérimentale"@fr, "datos experimentais"@gl, "kísérleti adatok"@hu, "dati sperimentali"@it, "実験データ"@ja, "실험 데이터"@ko, "experimentele data"@nl, "dados experimentais"@pt, "date experimentale"@ro, "экспериментальные данные"@ru, "eksperimentalni podatki"@sl, "eksperimentalni podaci"@sr, "експериментални подаци"@sr-cyrl, "experimentella data"@sv, "deneysel veri"@tr, "експериментальні дані"@uk, "实验数据"@zh .
<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/6nc7-gk9s> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "prepis"@sl, "誊写记录"@zh; skos:broadMatch <http://purl.org/datacite/v4.4/Text>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_18cf>; skos:definition "A written record of words spoken in court proceedings or in a speech, interview, broadcast, or sound recording. [Source: Adapted from https://products.abc-clio.com/ODLIS/odlis_t.aspx]"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/6NC7-GK9S>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "نسخ نصي"@ar, "transkripsiya"@az, "transcripció"@ca, "transskription"@da, "Transkription"@de, "μεταγραφή"@el, "transcription"@en, "transcripción"@es, "litteroitu teksti"@fi, "transcription"@fr, "transcrición"@gl, "transzkripció"@hu, "trascrizione"@it, "文字起こし"@ja, "전사"@ko, "transcriptie"@nl, "transcrição"@pt, "transcriere"@ro, "транскрипция"@ru, "transkripcija"@sl, "transkript"@sr, "транскрипт"@sr-cyrl, "transkription"@sv, "transkripsiyon"@tr, "траскрипт"@uk, "转录资料"@zh .
<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/8kjg-qs0y> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "equipament de laboratori"@ca, "instrumentació científica"@ca, "equipamiento de laboratorio"@es, "instrumentación científica"@es, "instrumentación científica"@gl, "strumento di ricerca"@it, "strumento scientifico"@it, "instrumento de pesquisa"@pt, "raziskovalni inštrument"@sl; skos:definition "A device, tool or apparatus used to obtain, measure and/or analyze data. Source https://datacite-metadata-schema.readthedocs.io/en/4.5/appendices/appendix-1/resourceTypeGeneral/#instrument"@en; skos:editorialNote "New concept included for version 4 of resource types Vocab"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/8KJG-QS0Y>, <https://w3id.org/skgo/modsci#ScientificInstrument>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "أداة بحث"@ar, "tədqiqat aləti"@az, "instrument de recerca"@ca, "forskningsinstrument"@da, "Forschungsinstrument"@de, "ερευνητικό εργαλείο"@el, "research instrument"@en, "instrumento de investigación"@es, "tutkimusväline"@fi, "instrument de recherche"@fr, "instrumento de investigación"@gl, "kutatási eszköz"@hu, "strumentazione"@it, "実験装置"@ja, "연구장비"@ko, "onderzoeksinstrument"@nl, "instrumento de investigação"@pt, "instrument de cercetare"@ro, "инструмент исследования"@ru, "raziskovalno orodje"@sl, "istraživački instrument"@sr, "истраживачки инструмент"@sr-cyrl, "forskningsinstrument"@sv, "araştırma cihazı"@tr, "інструмент дослідження"@uk, "研究工具"@zh; skos:topConceptOf <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme> .
<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/9dkx-ksaf> a skos:Concept; skos:broadMatch <https://sparontologies.github.io/fabio/current/fabio.html#d4e4175>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_15cd>; skos:definition "A special form of patent right granted by a state or jurisdiction to an inventor or the inventor’s assignee for a fixed period of time. The terms and conditions for granting a utility model are slightly different from those for normal patents (including a shorter term of protection and less stringent patentability requirements). The term can also describe what are known in certain countries as “petty patents,” “short-term patents” or “innovation patents.” [Source: https://www.wipo.int/edocs/pubdocs/en/wipo_pub_943_2018.pdf]"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/9DKX-KSAF>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "نموذج منفعة"@ar, "faydalı model"@az, "model d'utilitat"@ca, "brugsmodel"@da, "Gebrauchsmuster"@de, "μοντέλο χρησιμότητας"@el, "utility model"@en, "modelo de utilidad"@es, "hyödyllisyysmalli"@fi, "modèle d'utilité"@fr, "modelo de utilidade"@gl, "használati minta"@hu, "modello di utilità"@it, "実用新案"@ja, "실용신안"@ko, "gebruiksmodel"@nl, "modelo de utilidade"@pt, "model de utilitate"@ro, "полезная модель"@ru, "patent s skrajšanim trajanjem"@sl, "mali patent"@sr, "мали патент"@sr-cyrl, "bruksmodell"@sv, "faydalı model"@tr, "корисна модель"@uk, "实用新型专利"@zh .
<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/a8f1-npv9> a skos:Concept; skos:broadMatch <http://purl.org/datacite/v4.4/Dataset>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_ddb1>; skos:definition "Genomic data refers to the genome and DNA data of an organism. They are used in bioinformatics for collecting, storing and processing the genomes of living things. Genomic data is a more extensive term than sequencing data. However genomic data mostly come from sequencing techniques. It may include non-sequencing data such as data from microarrays, data from real-time PCR panels and data from pharmacogenomics studies. [Source: Adapted from https://www.techopedia.com/definition/31247/genomic-data]"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/A8F1-NPV9>, <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/EFO_0004600>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "بيانات جينومية"@ar, "genomik məlumatlar"@az, "dades genòmiques"@ca, "genomiske data"@da, "Genomdaten"@de, "γονιδιωματικά δεδομένα"@el, "genomic data"@en, "datos genómicos"@es, "genomidata"@fi, "donnée génomique"@fr, "datos xenómicos"@gl, "genomikai adatok"@hu, "dati genomici"@it, "ゲノムデータ"@ja, "지놈 데이터"@ko, "genomische data"@nl, "dados genómicos"@pt, "date genomice"@ro, "геномные данные"@ru, "genomski podatki"@sl, "genomski podaci"@sr, "геномски подаци"@sr-cyrl, "genomiska data"@sv, "genomik veri"@tr, "геномні дані"@uk, "基因组数据"@zh .
<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/acf7-8yt9> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "بيانات تلخيصية"@ar, "toplanmış məlumatlar"@az, "date cumulate"@ro, "izpeljani podatki"@sl, "združeni podatki"@sl; skos:broadMatch <http://purl.org/datacite/v4.4/Dataset>, <https://vocabs.lter-europe.net/elter_cl/en/page/10016>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_ddb1>; skos:definition "Statistics that relate to broad classes, groups, or categories. The data are averaged, totaled, or otherwise derived from individual-level data, and it is no longer possible to distinguish the characteristics of individuals within those classes, groups, or categories. For example, the number and age group of the unemployed in specific geographic regions, or national level statistics on the occurrence of specific offences, originally derived from the statistics of individual police districts. [Source: https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/ModeOfCollection_3.0.html]"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/ACF7-8YT9>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "بيانات مدمجة"@ar, "ümumiləşdirilmiş məlumatlar"@az, "dades agregades"@ca, "aggregerede data"@da, "aggregierte Daten"@de, "συγκεντρωτικά δεδομένα"@el, "aggregated data"@en, "datos agregados"@es, "aggregoitu tilastotieto"@fi, "données agrégées"@fr, "datos agregados"@gl, "aggregált adatok"@hu, "dati aggregati"@it, "集計データ"@ja, "집계 데이터"@ko, "geaggregeerde data"@nl, "dados agregados"@pt, "date agregate"@ro, "агрегированные данные"@ru, "agregirani podatki"@sl, "agregirani podaci"@sr, "агрегирани подаци"@sr-cyrl, "aggregerade data"@sv, "toplanmış veri"@tr, "агреговані дані"@uk, "聚合数据"@zh .
<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/am6w-6qaw> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "donnée codée"@fr, "date codificate"@ro; skos:broadMatch <http://purl.org/datacite/v4.4/Dataset>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_ddb1>; skos:definition "Qualitative data (textual, video, audio or still-image) originally produced for other purposes into quantitative data (expressed in unit-by-variable matrices) by using coding techniques in accordance with pre-defined categorization schemes. For example, coded party manifesto data like the \"European Parliament Election Study 2009, Manifesto Study\" (doi:10.4232/1.10204)\". [Source: Adapted from https://ddialliance.org/Specification/DDI-CV/ModeOfCollection_3.0.html]"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/AM6W-6QAW>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "بيانات مشفرة"@ar, "kodlaşdırılmış məlumatlar"@az, "dades codificades"@ca, "kodede data"@da, "kodierte Daten"@de, "κωδικοποιημένα δεδομένα"@el, "encoded data"@en, "datos codificados"@es, "koodattu data"@fi, "donnée encodée"@fr, "datos codificados"@gl, "kódolt adatok"@hu, "dati codificati"@it, "符号化データ"@ja, "부호화 데이터"@ko, "geëncodeerde data"@nl, "dados codificados"@pt, "date criptate"@ro, "кодированные данные"@ru, "kodirani podatki"@sl, "kodirani podaci"@sr, "кодирани подаци"@sr-cyrl, "kodad data"@sv, "kodlanmış veri"@tr, "кодовані дані"@uk, "编码数据"@zh .
<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/bw7t-ym2g> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "maquetació"@ca, "Layoutentwurf"@de, "kytkentäkaavio"@fi, "schéma d'implantation"@fr, "레이아웃 설계"@ko, "design de aspect"@ro, "design de machetă"@ro, "макетирование"@ru; skos:broadMatch <https://ncicb.nci.nih.gov/ncimbrowser/ConceptReport.jsp?dictionary=NCI%20Metathesaurus&code=C1707689>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/542X-3S04>; skos:definition """Layout-design (topography) means the three-dimensional disposition, however expressed, of 
the elements of an integrated circuit (at least one of which is an active element) and of some or all of the interconnections of an integrated circuit, or such a three-dimensional disposition prepared for 
