<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/c_18gh> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "تقرير تقني"@ar, "informe tecnico"@es, "reporte tecnico"@es, "reporte técnico"@es, "技術報告"@zh; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_93fc>; skos:definition "A document that describes the process, progress, or results of technical or scientific research or the state of a technical or scientific research problem. It might also include recommendations and conclusions of the research. [Source: http://guides.library.cornell.edu/ecommons/types]"@en; skos:editorialNote "Published"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_18gh>, <https://sparontologies.github.io/fabio/current/fabio.html#d4e5659>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "تقرير فني"@ar, "texniki hesabat"@az, "informe tècnic"@ca, "technická zpráva"@cs, "teknisk rapport"@da, "technischer Bericht"@de, "τεχνική έκθεση"@el, "technical report"@en, "informe técnico"@es, "tekninen raportti"@fi, "rapport technique"@fr, "informe técnico"@gl, "műszaki jelentés"@hu, "rapporto tecnico"@it, "テクニカルレポート"@ja, "기술 보고서"@ko, "technisch rapport"@nl, "relatório técnico"@pt, "raport tehnic"@ro, "технический отчет"@ru, "tehnično poročilo"@sl, "tehnički izveštaj"@sr, "технички извештај"@sr-cyrl, "teknisk rapport"@sv, "teknik rapor"@tr, "технічний звіт"@uk, "技术报告"@zh .
<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/c_18hj> ns1:expires "2021-03-12"; a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "informe a agencia financiadora"@es, "reporte a agencia de financiamento"@es, "rapport au financeur"@fr, "rapportage voor financier"@nl, "relatório para agência de financiamento"@pt, "relatório para financiador"@pt, "končno poročilo o rezultatih raziskav"@sl, "poročilo financerjem projekta"@sl, "給資助機構的報告"@zh; skos:definition "A report to a funding agency is a document written by beneficiaries of project grants. The reporting documents can be e.g. periodic reports about progress of scientific and technical work and final report. For deliverables use ‘Project deliverable’. [Source: http://ec.europa.eu/research/participants/fp7documents/funding-guide/6_projects/reports/reports_en.htm ]"@en; skos:editorialNote "Deprecated"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_18hj>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "تقرير لوكالة تمويل"@ar, "informe per una agència de finançament"@ca, "zpráva pro poskytovatele podpory"@cs, "Bericht an Förderorganisation"@de, "report to funding agency"@en, "informe a organismo financiador"@es, "rapport à l'intention du financeur"@fr, "rapporto a un'agenzia di finanziamento"@it, "助成研究成果報告書"@ja, "relatório para organismo financiador"@pt, "poročilo financerjem raziskave"@sl, "fon sağlayıcıya rapor"@tr, "给资助机构的报告"@zh; skos:topConceptOf <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme> .
