<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/c_18ws> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "تقرير البحث"@ar, "informe científic"@ca, "memòria científica"@ca, "informe cientifico"@es, "informe de investigacion"@es, "informe de investigación"@es, "informe del resultado de una investigación"@es, "memoria científica"@es, "reporte cientifico"@es, "reporte científico"@es, "reporte de investigación"@es, "rapport scientifique"@fr, "研究報告"@zh, "科研報告"@zh, "科研报告"@zh, "調研報告"@zh, "调研报告"@zh; skos:broadMatch <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/MESH/D058028>, <http://purl.org/datacite/v4.4/Report>, <https://sparontologies.github.io/fabio/current/fabio.html#d4e5170>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_93fc>; skos:definition "It is publication that reports on the findings of a research project or alternatively scientific observations on or about a subject. [Source: Adapted from https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Research_report]"@en; skos:editorialNote "Published"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_18ws>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "تقرير بحثي"@ar, "tədqiqat hesabatı"@az, "informe de recerca"@ca, "výzkumná zpráva"@cs, "forskningsrapport"@da, "Forschungsbericht"@de, "ερευνητική έκθεση"@el, "research report"@en, "informe científico"@es, "tutkimusraportti"@fi, "rapport de recherche"@fr, "informe de investigación"@gl, "kutatási jelentés"@hu, "rapporto di ricerca"@it, "研究報告書"@ja, "연구 보고서"@ko, "onderzoeksrapport"@nl, "relatório de investigação"@pt, "raport de cercetare"@ro, "исследовательский отчет"@ru, "poročilo o rezultatih raziskav"@sl, "izveštaj o istraživanju"@sr, "извештај о истраживању"@sr-cyrl, "forskningsrapport"@sv, "araştırma raporu"@tr, "звіт про дослідження"@uk, "研究报告"@zh .
<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/c_18ww> ns1:expires "2021-03-12"; a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "reporte de uso interno"@es, "notranje poročilo"@sl, "內部報告"@zh; skos:definition "An internal report is a record of findings collected for internal use. It is not designed to be made public and may include confidential or proprietary information."@en; skos:editorialNote "Deprecated"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_18ww>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "تقرير داخلي"@ar, "informe intern"@ca, "interní zpráva"@cs, "interner Bericht"@de, "internal report"@en, "informe interno"@es, "rapport interne"@fr, "rapporto interno"@it, "内部報告書"@ja, "intern rapport"@nl, "relatório interno"@pt, "interno poročilo"@sl, "interni izveštaj"@sr, "интерни извештај"@sr-cyrl, "dahili rapor"@tr, "内部报告"@zh; skos:topConceptOf <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/scheme> .
<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/c_18wz> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "memòria"@ca, "memorandum"@da, "Denkschrift"@de, "circular"@es, "comunicación"@es, "comunicado"@es, "memorandum"@fr, "circular"@pt, "comunicado"@pt, "razprava"@sl, "備忘錄"@zh; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_93fc>; skos:definition "A formal note distributed internally to one or more persons in a company, agency, organization, or institution, with a header indicating the date it was sent and stating to whom it is addressed (To:), from whom it is sent (From:), and the subject of the text (Re:). Unlike a letter, a memo does not require a full salutation or signature at the end of the text--the sender may simply initial his or her name in the header. [Source: https://products.abc-clio.com/ODLIS/odlis_m.aspx#memorandum]"@en; skos:editorialNote "Published"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_18wz>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "مذكرة"@ar, "memorandum"@az, "memoràndum"@ca, "memorandum"@cs, "notat"@da, "Memorandum"@de, "μνημόνιο"@el, "memorandum"@en, "memorándum"@es, "muistio"@fi, "mémo"@fr, "memorando"@gl, "emlékeztető"@hu, "memorandum"@it, "メモランダム"@ja, "memorandum"@nl, "memorando"@pt, "memorandum"@ro, "меморандум"@ru, "memorandum"@sl, "memorandum"@sr, "меморандум"@sr-cyrl, "memorandum"@sv, "bilgi notu"@tr, "меморандум"@uk, "备忘录"@zh .
