<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/dx5j-ta9r> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "plan de síntesis del conocimiento"@es, "plan de síntese do coñecemento"@gl, "protocol de evaluare a cunostințelor"@ro, "metodologija sinteze znanja"@sl, "načrt raziskave"@sl, "protokol za sintezo znanja"@sl; skos:broadMatch <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/MESH/D000078182>, <https://sparontologies.github.io/fabio/current/fabio.html#d4e5605>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_93fc>; skos:definition "In the context of systematic reviews and meta-analyses, a protocol is a document that presents an explicit plan for a systematic review. The protocol details the rationale and a priori methodological and analytical approach of the review. https://www.bmj.com/content/349/bmj.g7647"@en; skos:editorialNote "New concept included t be added to upcoming version 4.0"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/DX5J-TA9R>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "بروتوكول توليف المعرفة"@ar, "biliyin sintezi protokolu"@az, "protocol de síntesi del coneixement"@ca, "systematisk protokol"@da, "Wissenssyntheseprotokoll"@de, "πρωτόκολλο σύνθεσης γνώσης"@el, "knowledge synthesis protocol"@en, "protocolo de síntesis del conocimiento"@es, "systemaattisen katsauksen protokolla"@fi, "protocole de synthèse"@fr, "protocolo de síntese do coñecemento"@gl, "szakirodalom áttekintési protokoll"@hu, "protocollo di sintesi"@it, "知識統合プロトコル"@ja, "지식통합 프로토콜"@ko, "kennissynthese protocol"@nl, "protocolo de síntese de conhecimentos"@pt, "protocol de sinteză a cunostințelor"@ro, "протокол синтеза знаний"@ru, "metodologija raziskave"@sl, "prokoll vid systematisk översikt"@sv, "bilgi sentezi protokolü"@tr, "протокол синтезу знань"@uk, "知识综合协议"@zh .
