<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/h9bq-739p> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "revisió d'experts"@ca, "revisió entre iguals"@ca, "revisió per parells"@ca, "peerreview"@da, "validation par les pairs"@fr, "av aliación por expertos"@gl, "collegiale toetsing"@nl, "naučna ili stručna recenzija"@sr, "научна или стручна рецензија"@sr-cyrl, "peer review"@sv, "sakkunniggranskning"@sv, "hakem değerlendirmesi"@tr; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_efa0>; skos:definition "An evaluation of scientific, academic, or professional work by others working in the same field. [Source: Adopted from https://schema.datacite.org/meta/kernel-4.4/doc/DataCite-MetadataKernel_v4.4.pdf]"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/H9BQ-739P>, <http://purl.org/datacite/v4.4/PeerReview>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "مراجعة الأقران"@ar, "ekspert dəyərləndirməsi"@az, "avaluació d'experts"@ca, "fagfællebedømmelse"@da, "Gutachten"@de, "ομότιμη αξιολόγηση"@el, "peer review"@en, "revisión por pares"@es, "vertaisarviointi"@fi, "évaluation par les pairs"@fr, "revisión por pares"@gl, "szakmai lektorálás"@hu, "revisione tra pari"@it, "査読"@ja, "동료심사"@ko, "peerreview"@nl, "revisão por pares"@pt, "evaluare inter pares"@ro, "экспертная оценка"@ru, "strokovna ocena"@sl, "recenzija"@sr, "рецензија"@sr-cyrl, "refereegranskning"@sv, "akran değerlendirmesi"@tr, "рецензування"@uk, "同行评议"@zh .
<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/jbnf-dyad> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "dessin industriel"@fr; skos:broadMatch <https://ncicb.nci.nih.gov/ncimbrowser/ConceptReport.jsp?dictionary=NCI%20Metathesaurus&code=C1707689>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/542X-3S04>; skos:definition "Industrial designs are applied to a wide variety of industrial products and handicrafts. They refer to the ornamental or aesthetic aspects of a useful article,including compositions of lines or colors or any three-dimensional forms that give a special appearance to a product or handicraft. [Source: https://www.wipo.int/edocs/pubdocs/en/wipo_pub_943_2018.pdf]"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/JBNF-DYAD>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "تصميم صناعي"@ar, "sənaye dizaynı"@az, "disseny industrial"@ca, "industriel formgivning"@da, "Industriedesign"@de, "βιομηχανικός σχεδιασμός"@el, "industrial design"@en, "diseño industrial"@es, "tuotesuunnnitelma"@fi, "schéma industriel"@fr, "deseño industrial"@gl, "ipari formatervezés"@hu, "schema industriale"@it, "工業デザイン"@ja, "산업디자인"@ko, "industrieel ontwerp"@nl, "desenho industrial"@pt, "design industrial"@ro, "промышленный дизайн"@ru, "industrijsko oblikovanje"@sl, "industrijski dizajn"@sr, "индустријски дизајн"@sr-cyrl, "industridesign"@sv, "endüstriyel tasarım"@tr, "промисловий дизайн"@uk, "工业图纸"@zh .
<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/mw8g-3cr8> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "brevet logiciel"@fr, "octrooi op software"@nl, "softverski patent"@sr, "софтверски патент"@sr-cyrl, "软件专利"@zh; skos:broadMatch <http://purl.org/datacite/v4.4/Software>, <https://sparontologies.github.io/fabio/current/fabio.html#d4e4551>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_15cd>; skos:definition "In order to obtain a patent, a software invention must not fall under other non-patentable subject matter (for example, abstract ideas or mathematical theories) and has to fulfill the other substantive patentability criteria (for example, novelty, inventive step [non-obviousness] and industrial applicability [usefulness]). [Source: https://www.wipo.int/patents/en/faq_patents.html]"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/MW8G-3CR8>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "براءة اختراع برمجيات"@ar, "proqram təminatı patenti"@az, "patent de programari"@ca, "software-patent"@da, "Softwarepatent"@de, "ευρεσιτεχνία λογισμικού"@el, "software patent"@en, "patente de software"@es, "ohjelmistopatentti"@fi, "brevet de logiciel"@fr, "patente de software"@gl, "szoftverszabadalom"@hu, "brevetto software"@it, "ソフトウェア特許"@ja, "소프트웨어 특허"@ko, "softwarepatent"@nl, "patente de software"@pt, "patent de software"@ro, "патент на программное обеспечение"@ru, "patent za programsko opremo"@sl, "patentirani softver"@sr, "патентирани софтвер"@sr-cyrl, "mjukvarupatent"@sv, "yazılım patenti"@tr, "патент на програмне забезпечення"@uk, "软件著作权"@zh .
<https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes/nhd0-w6sy> a skos:Concept; skos:altLabel "sorğu datası"@az, "dades topogràfiques"@ca, "survey-aineisto"@fi, "données de sondage"@fr, "onderzoeksgegevens"@nl, "date din sondaj"@ro; skos:broadMatch <http://purl.org/datacite/v4.4/Dataset>; skos:broader <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/c_ddb1>; skos:definition "Data resulting from a survey, which is defined as an investigation about the characteristics of a given population by means of collecting data from a sample of that population and estimating their characteristics through the systematic use of statistical methodology. Included are censuses, sample surveys, the collection of data from administrative records and derived statistical activities as well as questionnaires. [Source: Adapted from https://stats.oecd.org/glossary/detail.asp?ID=2620]"@en; skos:exactMatch <http://purl.org/coar/resource_type/NHD0-W6SY>; skos:inScheme <https://nma.eosc.cz/vocabularies/resourcetypes>; skos:prefLabel "بيانات مسحية"@ar, "sorğu məlumatları"@az, "dades d'enquestes"@ca, "undersøgelsesdata"@da, "Umfragedaten"@de, "δεδομένα έρευνας"@el, "survey data"@en, "datos de encuesta"@es, "haastatteluaineisto"@fi, "donnée d'enquête"@fr, "datos de enquisa"@gl, "felmérési adatok"@hu, "dati di indagine"@it, "調査データ"@ja, "설문조사 데이터"@ko, "onderzoeksdata"@nl, "dados de inquéritos"@pt, "date de sondaj"@ro, "данные опроса"@ru, "anketni podatki"@sl, "anketni podaci"@sr, "анкетни подаци"@sr-cyrl, "undersökningsdata"@sv, "anket verisi"@tr, "дані опитування"@uk, "调查数据"@zh .
